  "translate_en|mods/ExtremeWeather/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_ExtremeWeather_EnableWildfire_tooltip": "Hot, dry, windy days when a fire front sweeps in from the countryside, burning grass and trees and anything in its way, buildings included. Needs the vanilla fire spread option on to spread beyond the front. June to October.",
